working together and
dating... look. it's complicated.

539
00:20:23.337 --> 00:20:25.386
No. no. no. I-I'm not
saying I want to stop.

540
00:20:25.470 --> 00:20:28.562
Okay? I don't.Good. Same.

541
00:20:28.646 --> 00:20:31.740
It's just on this one.

542
00:20:31.824 --> 00:20:33.652
I think you need to
bring it to your mom.

543
00:20:34.696 --> 00:20:36.005
Oh.

544
00:20:36.089 --> 00:20:38.746
Yeah. Okay.Yeah.

545
00:20:38.830 --> 00:20:43.226
