677
00:26:31.882 --> 00:26:33.751
but knowing you.
it's probably an insult.

678
00:26:33.836 --> 00:26:36.449
I always forget how your
generation is just so sensitive.

679
00:26:36.534 --> 00:26:39.915
I never forget how yours is not.

680
00:26:41.384 --> 00:26:43.104
What is wrong with my
Lakeshore credit card?

681
00:26:43.188 --> 00:26:45.322
What a stupid question.
What do you...

682
00:26:47.567 --> 00:26:49.658
