695
00:27:15.765 --> 00:27:17.161
Yeah.

696
00:27:18.087 --> 00:27:19.728
God. you're a fool.

697
00:27:19.812 --> 00:27:22.120
Oh... A shortsighted fool.

698
00:27:22.204 --> 00:27:25.080
because even if you do
manage to get your old job back.

699
00:27:25.164 --> 00:27:27.212
your department's gonna
