709
00:27:46.751 --> 00:27:48.059
that's less than a penny a club.

710
00:27:48.143 --> 00:27:51.802
That is not what
"amortized" means.

711
00:27:51.886 --> 00:27:56.283
I want those devices
returned and refunded.

712
00:27:58.430 --> 00:27:59.855
All right. Vivi. I hear you.

713
00:27:59.939 --> 00:28:01.227
I'm not in the business

714
00:28:01.312 --> 00:28:03.402
