that I dealt with.

717
00:28:08.498 --> 00:28:11.938
Th... What. this is an
actual. live person?

718
00:28:12.124 --> 00:28:14.117
Bit of a dud. but he's alive.

719
00:28:14.202 --> 00:28:16.276
He did the deal. I don't
know if he wants to undo it.

720
00:28:16.360 --> 00:28:18.350
Nobody wants to
refund $2 million.

721
00:28:18.434 --> 00:28:20.528
- We'll see about that.
- Thing is. there is a way

722
00:28:20.612 --> 00:28:23.182
