724
00:28:25.441 --> 00:28:27.011
They're actually smart clubs.

725
00:28:27.095 --> 00:28:29.446
They compensate for
hooks and slices... Fine.

726
00:28:30.622 --> 00:28:32.492
Get back to work.

727
00:28:36.848 --> 00:28:38.634
Hey.

728
00:28:38.945 --> 00:28:40.212
Ready for the Whipple?

729
00:28:40.297 --> 00:28:41.867
Please. don't. No.
no. no... Can I help?

730
00:28:41.959 --> 00:28:43.787
Come on. What?

731
00:28:46.027 --> 00:28:48.117
What... Hey.

732
00:28:48.202 --> 00:28:49.729
It's a conversation.
It doesn't matter.

733
