They see me as your
mistress first. doctor second.

735
00:28:55.788 --> 00:28:57.531
That's not true.

736
00:28:57.616 --> 00:28:59.143
You have no idea.

737
00:28:59.228 --> 00:29:00.495
All right? It was
already hard enough

738
00:29:00.579 --> 00:29:01.634
